  TWINGATE_CONNECTOR_NAME  Docker container name (default: twingate-mccon)
  TWINGATE_DOCKER_IMAGE    Connector image (default: twingate/connector:1)
  TWINGATE_DOCKER_BIN      Docker executable (default: docker)
